sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant Ctrl as Controller
    participant S as Service
    participant DB as Database (Prisma)

    C->>Ctrl: POST /login (email, password)
    Ctrl->>Ctrl: Validasi format input
    Ctrl->>S: autentikasi(email, password)
    S->>DB: SELECT * FROM pengguna WHERE email = ?
    DB-->>S: Return pengguna (termasuk passwordHash)
    S->>S: Split hash → (algorithm, salt, expectedKey)
    S->>S: scrypt(password, salt) → actualKey
    S->>S: timingSafeEqual(actualKey, expectedKey)?
    alt Cocok
        S-->>Ctrl: Return ProfilPublik
        Ctrl-->>C: 200 OK (JSON Profil)
    else Tidak Cocok
        S-->>Ctrl: Return null
        Ctrl-->>C: 401 Unauthorized ("Email atau password tidak sesuai")
    end